<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/15/eng@/~cl_32__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who was operating or providing any service relating to an intermediation business, before the date of coming into operation of this Act, shall make an application for a licence in accordance with this Act within one year from the date of coming into operation of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/15/eng@> .
